Z||000021||RobertVol||10-01-2000||01:34 AM||||Phew ! man stay away a couple of days and the Forum is popping!!<P>Well P man I agree with the above statements about we offer help to each other out of respect for our fondness for the beloved 2 seater BUT as said .....we "OFFER"help, not have to. <P>I have a 3.8 Sc and so does Phil and I believe Dan has a N/A 3.8. The splicing of the engine ECM setup can actually be purchased seperately for the conversion for a reasonable fee. They charge because they do all the work but if you want the links or contact info let me know. I also believe ACE will provide the SCHEME 's on that for a little cost. Try them. I know they will charge but again they do the work and research they will charge to provide the info. <P>And just a little parting comment:<P>Not everyone is a gearhead on the forum. I love my cars but Work alot and did not have the time for this type of conversion. So I paid someone for all the work. I can't speak for Phil but I was out of the loop. Car was done and I gave them the check! That was it. But any other questions, such as performance or problems had.. I would be GLAD to answer.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>Robert<BR>88GT Top 3.8 SC t top <BR>88GT T top 55k for sale<BR>  <A HREF="http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros" TARGET=_blank>http://fullspeed.to/NorthFLFieros</A>  <BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fortunecity.com/marina/strand/1086/3eab6a20.jpg"> ||||reg||1
